  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut pumpkin into bite-sized chunks (peel if preferred) and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle with BBQ spice blend, a pinch of salt and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins. In the last 5 mins, sprinkle the pumpkin with Cheddar cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651517131f7307dd304ae41b-fc620d4e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Drain sweetcorn.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic and corn until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add jasmine rice, the water and the salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651517131f7307dd304ae41b-fa128d98.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the pumpkin has 5 mins remaining, combine slaw mix, a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil in a large bowl. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651517131f7307dd304ae41b-15a2a34a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide corn rice and slaw between bowls.\n• Top with cheesy southern BBQ roast pumpkin and drizzle with dill & parsley mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-651517131f7307dd304ae41b-00e80bec.jpeg"
    }
  ]
